  "question": {
    "text": "A wooden block of mass $5 \\mathrm{~kg}$ rests on a soft horizontal floor. When an iron cylinder of mass $25 \\mathrm{~kg}$ is placed on the top of the block, the floor yields and the block and the cylinder together go down with an acceleration of $0.1 \\mathrm{~ms}^{-2}$. The action force of the system on the floor is equal to:"
