    "text": "Taking $\\mathrm{g}=9.8 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}^2$\n<img src=\"assets\\st0016_54298a3acbfb.png\"><br />$\\begin{aligned} & 294-\\mathrm{N}=30 \\times 0.1 \\\\ & \\mathrm{~N}=291\\end{aligned}$"
